WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.458
If you can find a laugh,

00:00:01.458 --> 00:00:02.583
you'll find ease. 

00:00:02.583 --> 00:00:04.541
Laugh at everything.

00:00:07.625 --> 00:00:09.166
“Kevin, What if I'm not funny?

00:00:09.166 --> 00:00:10.250
I don't know what to do.”

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.625
That's what I want to show you.

00:00:11.625 --> 00:00:13.833
This class is about how I built my career,

00:00:13.833 --> 00:00:15.375
relationships and life,

00:00:15.375 --> 00:00:16.291
 by using comedy

00:00:16.291 --> 00:00:17.541
and how you can to.

00:00:21.708 --> 00:00:23.250
D*mn, I'm pretty dope.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.541
My biggest advice
to anybody giving any type of speech,

00:00:27.541 --> 00:00:28.916
your speech has to have levels.

00:00:28.916 --> 00:00:31.000
My hand
movements, my voice.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.916
When I choose to elevate my voice

00:00:32.916 --> 00:00:34.333
versus when I get a little softer. 

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:36.333
It’s all a performance to some degree.

00:00:37.916 --> 00:00:39.583
What I think that humor does, 

00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:42.333
is soften whoever is on the other side

00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:43.916
to possibly talk to you more.

00:00:43.916 --> 00:00:46.333
Interviewer: It sounds like 
self-deprecation is like a...

00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:48.333
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:50.208
Use words

00:00:50.208 --> 00:00:52.583
 that I understand.

00:00:52.583 --> 00:00:54.583
I don't know what that means.

00:00:54.583 --> 00:00:56.458
Did you just call me dumb?

00:00:56.458 --> 00:00:57.208
Interviewer:
No, you’re just playing dumb.

00:00:57.208 --> 00:00:58.208
No, but you see how I did that?

00:00:58.208 --> 00:00:59.083
See, I broke it up.

00:00:59.083 --> 00:01:00.250
Now you got the laugh.

00:01:00.291 --> 00:01:03.458
You’re probably asking yourself,
“Why are you being so generous

00:01:03.458 --> 00:01:06.375
with all this information
and strategies that you’ve built

00:01:06.375 --> 00:01:07.583
to make yourself so successful?”

00:01:07.583 --> 00:01:09.000
“Why, Kevin? Why?”

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.458
I want you to
 know that comedy 

00:01:10.458 --> 00:01:11.875
isn’t just about stand-up.

00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:12.833
It's a life skill.

00:01:13.166 --> 00:01:15.666
My name is Kevin Hart,

00:01:15.666 --> 00:01:18.583
and this is MasterClass.

